{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan review PASS, current certified attestation. Advisory clarification: search uses existing REST failure policy unchanged. Network timeout/connection failures are transient and get that transport's bounded retries. HTTP errors (including transient 429/503) propagate after one HTTP attempt and fail the current pass; this fix adds no retry wrapper. Malformed pages and stalled cursors are fatal for the current search/pass. Any raised search evicts partial cache before propagation; an explicit later search or a later scheduled pass starts afresh, rather than treating failed partial results as complete. Local tests cover HTTP 429 propagation/cache recovery and fatal malformed/stalled responses. Full make verify has reported a test failure; awaiting complete output before remediation."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1791349660380757117,"uuid":"645bf9fb-5d49-4ec2-a72d-82bda351a737"}